      "statement": "The CaClient interface defines Sign, Renew, RenewWithToken, Revoke, Rekey, the SSH operations (SSHSign, SSHRenew, SSHRekey, SSHRevoke, SSHRoots, SSHFederation, SSHConfig, SSHCheckHost, SSHGetHosts, SSHBastion), Version, GetRootCAs, and GetCaURL, letting command actions serve both online and offline modes.",
