    {
      "id": "claim_deeb7a1618b14fc1abb782193aa8411b",
      "statement": "cautils.NewClient returns the offline CA when --offline is set (--ca-config then required), otherwise builds ca.NewClient from flags.ParseCaURL and --root, defaulting the root to $STEPPATH/certs/root_ca.crt and erroring with a required-flag error when neither exists.",
